OL,3,GNEWSAArtwork shines a light on women's
OL,4,Ahomelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn art installation has been helping to
OL,7,Fhighlight the experiences of women
OL,8,Ffacing homelessness, which campaigners
OL,9,Fsay is significantly undercounted in
OL,10,Fofficial figures.
OL,12,FThe display at the Arts by the Sea
OL,13,Ffestival in Bournemouth, Dorset, on
OL,14,FFriday and Saturday was designed by
OL,15,FLindsay Lyall, service manager for
OL,16,Fhomelessness charity St Mungo's.
OL,18,FEach pair of orange shoes was attached
OL,19,Fto a QR code linking to a real-life
OL,20,Fstory, which Lyall said helped to
OL,21,F"shine a light on experiences that are
OL,22,Foften overlooked".
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
